function RangeControl({ label, value, onChange, min, max, step = 1, suffix, hint }: { label: string; value: string; onChange: (value: string) => void; min: number; max: number; step?: number; suffix: string; hint: string }) {
  const numeric = Number(value) || min; const progress = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, ((numeric - min) / (max - min || 1)) * 100));
  return <div className="surface-card block p-3 font-sans text-[13.5px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-[#8791A1]"><div className="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><span>{label}</span><div className="flex items-center gap-1"><input aria-label={label} value={value} onChange={(event) => onChange(event.target.value)} type="number" min={min} max={max} step={step} className="parameter-value w-[76px] border border-white/[.1] bg-black/20 px-2 py-1.5 text-right font-mono text-[15px] font-bold normal-case tracking-normal text-[#F8FAFC] outline-none focus:border-[#F97316]" onBlur={() => { const next = Number(value); onChange(String(Math.min(max, Math.max(min, Number.isFinite(next) ? next : min)))); }}/><span className="font-mono text-[13.5px] normal-case tracking-normal text-[#687386]">{suffix}</span></div><span className="sr-only">{hint}</span></div><div className="relative mt-4 pb-3"><input aria-label={`${label} slider`} value={value} onChange={(event) => onChange(event.target.value)} type="range" min={min} max={max} step={step} className="tactile-range" style={{ "--range-progress": `${progress}%` } as React.CSSProperties}/><div className="range-ticks" aria-hidden="true">{[0, 25, 50, 75, 100].map((tick) => <i key={tick} style={{ left: `${tick}%` }}/>)}</div></div></div>;
}

function syntaxLine(line: string, language: "ts" | "json") {
  const pattern = /(\/\/.*$|"(?:\\.|[^"\\])*"|'(?:\\.|[^'\\])*'|\b(?:import|from|const|await|new|true|false|null|export|async|return)\b|\b(?:Connection|PublicKey|DynamicBondingCurveClient|EvtCreateConfigV2)\b|\b\d+(?:\.\d+)?\b)/g;
  return line.split(pattern).filter(Boolean).map((chunk, index) => {
    let className = "";
    if (chunk.startsWith("//")) className = "tok-comment";
    else if (/^["']/.test(chunk)) className = "tok-string";
    else if (/^\d/.test(chunk)) className = "tok-number";
    else if (/^(Connection|PublicKey|DynamicBondingCurveClient|EvtCreateConfigV2)$/.test(chunk)) className = "tok-type";
    else if (language === "ts" && /^(import|from|const|await|new|true|false|null|export|async|return)$/.test(chunk)) className = "tok-keyword";
    else if (language === "json" && /^(true|false|null)$/.test(chunk)) className = "tok-keyword";
    return <span key={`${index}-${chunk}`} className={className}>{chunk}</span>;
  });
}

function IdeCode({ filename, code, language, actions }: { filename: string; code: string; language: "ts" | "json"; actions?: React.ReactNode }) {
  const lines = code.replace(/\r\n/g, "\n").split("\n");
  return <div className="ide-window"><div className="ide-titlebar px-3"><div className="mr-4 flex gap-1.5"><i className="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#FF5F57]"/><i className="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#FEBC2E]"/><i className="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#28C840]"/></div><div className="self-stretch border-x border-white/[.06] bg-black/20 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[13.5px] text-[#D7DCE5]">{filename}</div><div className="ml-auto">{actions}</div></div><pre className="scrollbar max-h-[560px] overflow-auto py-4 font-mono text-[13.5px] leading-6 text-[#C7CFDC]"><code className="ide-code">{lines.map((line, index) => <span className="ide-line px-2" key={`${filename}-${index}`}><span className="ide-gutter" aria-hidden="true">{index + 1}</span><span className="min-w-0 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">{line.length ? syntaxLine(line, language) : "\u00a0"}</span></span>)}</code></pre></div>;
}

